+        *   $P_1$: Check edges 2, 0, 1, 3. Pick the next valid $\lambda$.
+        *   $P_2$: Check edges 4, 5, 7. Pick the next valid $\lambda$.
+        *   $P_3$: Check edges 6, 4, 5, 7. Pick the next valid $\lambda$.
+        *   $P_4$: Check edges 8, 9, 11. Pick the next valid $\lambda$.
